    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quieres combatir contra nosotros?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 6552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005100750069006500720065007300200063006F006D0062006100740069007200200063006F006E0074007200610020006E006F0073006F00740072006F0073003F00100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Sí!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 6632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005300ED00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Todavía no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 6644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F00640061007600ED00610020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Apúrate, que me muero de ganas por combatir.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Tengo muchas ganas de saber cómo me va en\nun combate junto a Corvisquire!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 6668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 127
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vamos, demuéstrale a est<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāea Entrenador<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa tu fuerza,\n¡la misma con la que cruzaste el mar!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 6924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿9",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 7128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Corvisquire, da igual que hayamos perdido, ¡eres\nel mejor compañero que podría tener!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYo también me esforzaré por convertirme en un\nEntrenador en quien puedas confiar.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 7140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 175
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Genial, eres superfuerte, Corvisquire!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTendré que esforzarme para convertirme en un\nEntrenador que esté a tu altura.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 7492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 125
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Corviiis!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 7744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F00720076006900690069007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Entrenador<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa, jamás olvidaré este día.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 7768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E007400720065006E00610064006F007200100003110000FF01000061002C0020006A0061006D00E100730020006F006C0076006900640061007200E9002000650073007400650020006400ED0061002E00100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gracias, ¡mil millones de gracias!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 7864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047007200610063006900610073002C002000A1006D0069006C0020006D0069006C006C006F006E0065007300200064006500200067007200610063006900610073002100100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
